{"id":"twitter:2010407095989104879","tweet_id":"2010407095989104879","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2010407095989104879","title":"Under US criminal code and case law, the Officer in question is probably not culpable of the crime we all saw get committed. It is what it is. We inde","summary":"Under US criminal code and case law, the Officer in question is probably not culpable of the crime we all saw get committed. It is what it is. We indemnify a lot of police actions. We are watching the Government abuse this fact to fit their domestic terrorism narrative.","date":"2026-01-11","published":"2026-01-11T17:42:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Under US criminal code and case law, the Officer in question is probably not culpable of the crime we all saw get committed.<br><br>It is what it is. We indemnify a lot of police actions.<br><br>We are watching the Government abuse this fact to fit their domestic terrorism narrative.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2010407095989104879","display_date":"January 11, 2026 · 17:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
